{
  "id": "MRK.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 8",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni, hojja gumiini guddooni ta sagale inqamne wolti baate, Yesoni jara ufi yaame waan jed'eeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gumi tanaa naha, waan isiini guyya sadi na woliini oolte, ammalle amma waan nyaattu inqamneefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo anini beelaani galche, karaati gagabani, wonti akanatiifi nami gari fago d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari isa waan jed'e, Isi nami dandae lafa aloo tana keesati gumi hagana geetu tana inqufsa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni, Qit'a hagami qabdani? jed'e gaafate. Torba jed'ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani gumi teteesise qit'a torbaanu fuud'e galata Waaqa deebise, qit'a ch'ach'abse jara isaati kenne, biyya gololcha jed'eeni. Jennaani jari biyya gololche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri qurt'umi didiqo toko qaba. Yesoni eebimnaani, jara isatiini, Tanale biyyaa kenna jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaatani quufani, hamba dadu torba guutani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nyaate kunki afurifa. Jennaani Yesoni biyya ufira galche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hobolo seene, jara isaa woliini lafa Dalmanutha jed'ani d'aqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesoni akheekha worraa kennu dida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 11.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farisayooni d'ufte, Yesoni woi mormite, akheekha gubba isa iraa barbaade aka isa ilaalattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 11.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni maadefate waan jed'e, D'alooti kuni maafi akheekha barbaada? D'uguma wonti anini jed'u akheekha tokole d'aloota kanaa inkennani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra biraa deeme, hobolo keesa seene, gama kaaniti taake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waan barsiisa bukho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari isaa qit'a woreega ka isaani gahu fud'achu ded'ee, qit'a toko ch'allati hobolo keesa jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesoni waan Jara isatiini jed'e, Bukho Farisayootiifi ta Herode ira ufi eega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri waan woliini jed'e, Isii inni waan qit'a inqamneefi akasi jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesoni waan worri jed'e, Beennaani waan worraani jed'e Maafi waan qit'a inqamneefi dubbattani? Ammalle imbeetani yokhaani inhubatani? Qalbiini teesani guddo wo inhubattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 5.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani ila qabdani ammo woma inagartani? Gurra qabdani ammo ind'ageetani? Isani woma inqaabatani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa anini qit'a shani ch'ach'abse nama kunki shani nyaachise, isani hamba dadu hagami guurtani? Worri waan jed'e kud'ani lama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle gaafa anini qit'a torba ch'ach'abse nama kunki afuri nyaachise, isani hamba dadu hagami guurtani? Worri! Torba jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan worraani jed'e, Isani ammalle inhubanne re?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fayyisa balla Bethsaida keesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesofi jari isaa Bethsaida d'ufani. Biyyiti nama balla isatiini d'ufte, aka inni isa tuqu kad'atte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha balla harka qabe, olla keesaa alati baase, ila isaa hanch'ufa iti tufe, harka ira kaye, Woma garta? jed'e gaafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilti banamnaani, inni millate waan jed'e, Anini nama arga, ammo aka mukha yau fakaatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Yesoni harka ufi ila isaa ira kaye. Duuba namichi millate fayye, waan ch'ufa aka dansa arge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesoni iti d'aame waan jed'eeni, beeni gali ammo olla sunti indeebiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petroni, Atini Kristo Yesoni jed'a",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesoni jara ufi woliini ollowaani lafa Kaisaria Filipi jed'ani d'ufe. Kara keesati inni jara ufi gaafate waan jed'e, Biyyiti eennu naani jetti? jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.14+MRK.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 6.14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.7+LUK.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 9.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri waan jed'e, Nami gari Yohana nama batisu jed'a, ka gari Eliya jed'a, ammo ka gari raaga duri toko jed'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.68+JHN.6.69"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 6.68-69",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni worra gaafate waan jed'e, Isani ufi eennu naani jettani? Petroni waan jed'eeni, Atini Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni worraa seere, aka nama tokoleti inhimne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesoni waan duisa ufi dubbata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni worra barsiise waan jed'e, Ilmi Nama guddo gaargalu male, jaarolefi qaalole gugurdofi jari Seera beekhuleeni isa mormachu male. Isa ijeesani, ammo inni guyya sadeeso inkaa jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni jecha kana diideese dubbate. Petroni isa koba fuud'e, Jecha kana injed'ini! jed'e d'owe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Yesoni garagale, jara ufi ilaale, Petro d'owe waan jed'e, Nara fagaad'u, Sheet'ana! Atini waan Waaqa inhereddu, waan nama ch'alla heredda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
